<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-England win third test and series vs NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-England win third test and series vs NZ.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>England won the third cricket test when they beat New Zealand in the final session of the fifth day on Tuesay by four wickets.</p>
<p>England won the three match series 2-0.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 346 and 186.</p>
<p>England 228 and 307 for six wickets (M. Atherton 118, D. Vettori 4-97).</p>
